    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VAMPIRE SANDWICH</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you craft and stack sandwiches to serve vampire girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Press &quot;Request Access&quot; above to join\u00a0<strong>Steam</strong>\u00a0beta Playtest!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE SANDWICH-BUILDING MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack, stack, stack over 100 unique ingredient cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your own creative sandwich synergy and combos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE WORLD OF VAMPIRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience stories with characters that change every day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry vampires may attack you for blood if you don't meet them for too long!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISUAL NOVEL-STYLE ROGUELIKE DECKBUILDER EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards for fun dates with vampire beauties and maids. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get better rewards for making choices that please your characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    BEWARE THEIR THIRST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires don't settle for tasteless sandwiches!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep making delicious sandwiches, or you're going to run out of blood pretty quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7c9bcc08255e7f1f924710f0933e4cae.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VAMPIRE SANDWICH</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you craft and stack sandwiches to serve vampire girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Press &quot;Request Access&quot; above to join\u00a0<strong>Steam</strong>\u00a0beta Playtest!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE SANDWICH-BUILDING MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack, stack, stack over 100 unique ingredient cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your own creative sandwich synergy and combos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE WORLD OF VAMPIRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience stories with characters that change every day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry vampires may attack you for blood if you don't meet them for too long!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/1cf63eb99912c42000aa0332e605a519.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISUAL NOVEL-STYLE ROGUELIKE DECKBUILDER EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards for fun dates with vampire beauties and maids. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get better rewards for making choices that please your characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/f651a1395eb6012d11f67c759d90cb83.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    BEWARE THEIR THIRST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires don't settle for tasteless sandwiches!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep making delicious sandwiches, or you're going to run out of blood pretty quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.poster.avif?t=1731744644\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.webm?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014370/extras/7e0001a1b50cd2dc3661653ca10c2b83.mp4?t=1731744644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
